{"3211720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Erosion", "steam_appid": 3211720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/e09ebc9ebb9724773c9cbb44e45228e8.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/e09ebc9ebb9724773c9cbb44e45228e8.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your daughter's been kidnapped by a warlord and dragged into the mysterious living Pillar that warps time itself. You're gonna get her back. The catch? When you die, the world jumps forward a decade, aging your daughter and changing the world around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/1f8db2a805311788b49f2536ac0c0a21.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/1f8db2a805311788b49f2536ac0c0a21.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c034f2ba6293fd46b39aac90ae4f4806.poster.avif?t=1783123163\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c034f2ba6293fd46b39aac90ae4f4806.webm?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c034f2ba6293fd46b39aac90ae4f4806.mp4?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die in a dungeon? Wake up ten years later. That peaceful farm is now a cultist compound worshipping the Great Ol' Rooster. That store owner you helped? They've built an empire. Your choices permeate across decades, transforming factions, townsfolk, and entire regions. Once you’ve mastered full timeline control, you can rewrite every possible future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/70edc2138525656c004d6128c09f7948.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/70edc2138525656c004d6128c09f7948.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/bde31d7e64fa7ee85fab32519b7c7f5b.poster.avif?t=1783123163\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/bde31d7e64fa7ee85fab32519b7c7f5b.webm?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/bde31d7e64fa7ee85fab32519b7c7f5b.mp4?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a massive wasteland overworld where you can join a cult, steal a slick new ride, and gamble your hard-earned Cheddar away at the Al Cashino. Go sand fishing for buried creatures, hunt bounties, try your luck in duels, or just race trucks through the salt flats. Complete quests to unlock permanent upgrades and reshape the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/180c3ab5b6d2566be9f48617e2b02cd2.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/180c3ab5b6d2566be9f48617e2b02cd2.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c1f894ee6f31aaba7f8659f28942d657.poster.avif?t=1783123163\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c1f894ee6f31aaba7f8659f28942d657.webm?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c1f894ee6f31aaba7f8659f28942d657.mp4?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect dozens of weapons from ritual bows that draw their strength from your blood, to homing smart guns, to the legendary Ebony Rooster that shoots bouncy eggs. Experiment with 100+ skills and modifiers to create absurd synergies. Command an army of cats. Deploy orbital turrets. Clone yourself. The build possibilities are endless.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/05bfb793bddc85af55ed6e6c45de323a.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/05bfb793bddc85af55ed6e6c45de323a.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/b86e00ed0d0d37a95f1a22a162896c20.poster.avif?t=1783123163\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/b86e00ed0d0d37a95f1a22a162896c20.webm?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/b86e00ed0d0d37a95f1a22a162896c20.mp4?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible voxel environments mean cover is temporary and collateral damage is guaranteed. Blow up walls, turn locations into rubble, and flip the poker table! Physics-driven destruction meets bullet-hell combat for that sweet, sweet emergent mayhem. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/e09ebc9ebb9724773c9cbb44e45228e8.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/e09ebc9ebb9724773c9cbb44e45228e8.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your daughter's been kidnapped by a warlord and dragged into the mysterious living Pillar that warps time itself. You're gonna get her back. The catch? When you die, the world jumps forward a decade, aging your daughter and changing the world around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/1f8db2a805311788b49f2536ac0c0a21.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/1f8db2a805311788b49f2536ac0c0a21.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c034f2ba6293fd46b39aac90ae4f4806.poster.avif?t=1783123163\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c034f2ba6293fd46b39aac90ae4f4806.webm?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c034f2ba6293fd46b39aac90ae4f4806.mp4?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die in a dungeon? Wake up ten years later. That peaceful farm is now a cultist compound worshipping the Great Ol' Rooster. That store owner you helped? They've built an empire. Your choices permeate across decades, transforming factions, townsfolk, and entire regions. Once you’ve mastered full timeline control, you can rewrite every possible future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/70edc2138525656c004d6128c09f7948.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/70edc2138525656c004d6128c09f7948.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/bde31d7e64fa7ee85fab32519b7c7f5b.poster.avif?t=1783123163\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/bde31d7e64fa7ee85fab32519b7c7f5b.webm?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/bde31d7e64fa7ee85fab32519b7c7f5b.mp4?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a massive wasteland overworld where you can join a cult, steal a slick new ride, and gamble your hard-earned Cheddar away at the Al Cashino. Go sand fishing for buried creatures, hunt bounties, try your luck in duels, or just race trucks through the salt flats. Complete quests to unlock permanent upgrades and reshape the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/180c3ab5b6d2566be9f48617e2b02cd2.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/180c3ab5b6d2566be9f48617e2b02cd2.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c1f894ee6f31aaba7f8659f28942d657.poster.avif?t=1783123163\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c1f894ee6f31aaba7f8659f28942d657.webm?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/c1f894ee6f31aaba7f8659f28942d657.mp4?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect dozens of weapons from ritual bows that draw their strength from your blood, to homing smart guns, to the legendary Ebony Rooster that shoots bouncy eggs. Experiment with 100+ skills and modifiers to create absurd synergies. Command an army of cats. Deploy orbital turrets. Clone yourself. The build possibilities are endless.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/05bfb793bddc85af55ed6e6c45de323a.avif?t=1783123163\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras_big/05bfb793bddc85af55ed6e6c45de323a.webp?t=1783123163 width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/b86e00ed0d0d37a95f1a22a162896c20.poster.avif?t=1783123163\" width=1170 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/b86e00ed0d0d37a95f1a22a162896c20.webm?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/extras/b86e00ed0d0d37a95f1a22a162896c20.mp4?t=1783123163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible voxel environments mean cover is temporary and collateral damage is guaranteed. Blow up walls, turn locations into rubble, and flip the poker table! Physics-driven destruction meets bullet-hell combat for that sweet, sweet emergent mayhem. </p>", "short_description": "Your daughter's been kidnapped. Every death costs you a decade. Explore a roguelike open world where your actions reshape the timeline. Join a cult, steal a ride, gamble Cheddar. Collect 100+ weapons and abilities, demolish destructible voxel dungeons. Can you save her before time steals her away?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/0015c8cda29ef3a45def0a8a5613b242e7097732/header.jpg?t=1783123163", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/f07ddf76579c95b86ac3f88122633a7a6eea07bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783123163", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211720/f07ddf76579c95b86ac3f88122633a7a6eea07bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783123163", "website": "https://lyricalgames.co/game/erosion/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum